IMPORT prelude

-- Legislation Act 2003 (Commonwealth), sections 12 to 54: the nouns that more than one module uses.
-- Types only; no rules.
-- Text: C2004A01224.txt, compilation C2019C00084; it is not the authorised text.

-- The two Houses of the Parliament (sections 15DA, 38, 39, 41, 42, 47, 48, 52, 53 speak of "each House" or "a House").
DECLARE House IS ONE OF
    `the House of Representatives`
    `the Senate`

-- The three kinds of law the Register holds as made (sections 15A, 15L, 15Q, 15T): an Act, a legislative instrument, a notifiable instrument.
DECLARE `Registered law` IS ONE OF
    `an Act`
    `a legislative instrument`
    `a notifiable instrument`
